      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's easy to say that when you aren't the one watching them struggle. they look so tired. and i see it in their eyes. i feel like a parasite. if i really loved them, wouldn't i want them to have a life that isn't constantly being weighed down by my failures? sometimes it feels like the most selfless thing a person can do is just... step aside and let things be easy for everyone else.",
